            "review_title": "Review at VietStreet - Mon An Duong Pho",
            "review_text": "Steter\nCity of San Marino, San Marino80 contributions\n0\nPleasant quick lunch\nDec 2019 • Couples\nWe were up for a late lunch (went around 3/4pm) and the place was empty at that time. The staff welcomed us after showing us the menu. We ordered 2 different mains, 1 of rice and 1 of noodles and honestly we loved both. One was with chicken and some kind of dry fish I guess and the other were noodles with pork and some vegs plus their sauces. 2 meals with a mineral water about 200.000d. Maybe they charge too much for drinks but meals ok.\nFor us was a positive experience, hope others will get the same as usually in shopping malls they're quite hit or miss.\nRead more\nWritten December 14, 2019",
